      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A troglodyte’s skin changes color somewhat, allowing it to blend in with its surroundings like a chameleon. A troglodyte gains a +4 species bonus on @Check[skill:hide]{Hide check}s (+8 in a rocky or subterranean setting).</p>",
